{"about_the_game":"DreadEye VR is a virtual reality experience that allows you to become an Indonesian shaman (dukun). Craft and combine ingredients as you practice an ancient ritual, opening the gate to the spirit realm to commune with the dead. Immerse yourself in terrifying experiences set in haunted rural Indonesia, and discover the gruesome horrors lurking in the shadows!<br><br>Designed and developed from the ground up for fully immersive atmosphere and gameplay, DreadEye VR is our approach to a truly unsettling, macabre virtual reality experience.<br><br><u><strong>ABOUT THE RITUAL</strong></u><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/692930/extras/599f16a3216c72550f5f8767767826d4.poster.avif?t=1661347139\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/692930/extras/599f16a3216c72550f5f8767767826d4.webm?t=1661347139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/692930/extras/599f16a3216c72550f5f8767767826d4.mp4?t=1661347139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>1. Follow instructions</strong> - Consult the book for step-by-step methods to summon spirits.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/692930/extras/3458404c1668d4e9f3f82cf14cfd534b.poster.avif?t=1661347139\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/692930/extras/3458404c1668d4e9f3f82cf14cfd534b.webm?t=1661347139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/692930/extras/3458404c1668d4e9f3f82cf14cfd534b.mp4?t=1661347139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>2. Cook ingredients</stron